Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 18:07:45 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Replace the WhatsApp booking form with the Unify booking
 widget

The book-now page composed a WhatsApp message by hand and nothing was
recorded anywhere. It now mounts Unify's embeddable booking form, so every
booking lands in the Unify dashboard as a Pending reservation (source
"Website") against a real departure, with live seats remaining and
server-side pricing. WhatsApp stays as a secondary "prefer to chat" link.

Two values to set before this goes live (see the comment above the
section): the Unify tenant id and the deployed Unify host in the script src.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
